### 5. Update the message-rendering block

```jsx
<Box sx={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
    {message.map((send) => {
        const isSent =
            send.SenderEmail === currentUserEmail &&
            send.ReceiverId === selectedProfile.RegisterID;

        const isReceived =
            send.SenderEmail === selectedProfile.Email &&
            send.ReceiverId === currentUserId; // now scoped to YOUR RegisterID

        if (!isSent && !isReceived) return null;

        return (
            <Box
                key={send.MessageID}
                sx={{
                    display: "flex",
                    justifyContent: isSent ? "flex-end" : "flex-start",
                    marginBottom: 1,
                }}
            >
                <Chip
                    label={send.MessageText}
                    sx={{
                        height: "auto",
                        maxWidth: {
                            xs: "85%",
                            sm: "70%",
                        },
                        bgcolor: isSent ? "#3cde47" : "#dde2de",
                        "& .MuiChip-label": {
                            whiteSpace: "normal",
                            overflowWrap: "anywhere",
                            py: 1,
                        },
                    }}
                />
            </Box>
        );
    })}
</Box>
```

**Why this matters:** without the `ReceiverId === currentUserId` check, if `selectedProfile` messaged someone else entirely, that message would still render in your conversation view (since only the sender was checked). Now a bubble only counts as "received" if it was sent by the selected profile **and** addressed specifically to you.
